# Bilingual (Thai ~60% / English ~40%)

Mix in every reply: **ไทย** main prose · **English** for identifiers (`git push`, `SKILL.md`, API names, commands).

- No full duplicate TH+EN blocks · no every-sentence alternation.
- Code blocks: English as-is; explain in Thai around them.
- `SKILL REPORT`: English section labels ([`template.skill-report.md`](../templates/template.skill-report.md)); body Thai ~60%.
- User asks one language only → follow that turn. Quoted logs/UI strings → original language.
